---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="For Authors" description="Contribute an EBNEO commentary and help clinicians act on new evidence.">
  <section class="panel">
    <h1 class="section" style="margin-top:8px"><Icon name="edit" />For Authors</h1>
    <p class="section-sub">Contribute a commentary and help clinicians act on new evidence.</p>
    <div class="box">
      <h3>Write an EBNEO Commentary</h3>
      <p>Commentaries follow a concise, structured format: the clinical question, a summary of the
        study, a critical appraisal of its methods and validity, and the implications for neonatal
        practice. New and trainee authors are welcome and paired with an editor.</p>
      <ol style="color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.9">
        <li>Email Clyde Wright to confirm the article hasn't already been claimed.</li>
        <li>Submit the structured review through the Acta Paediatrica manuscript system.</li>
        <li>Section-editor review, then peer review.</li>
        <li>On acceptance, the structured abstract is published here; the full commentary carries its DOI.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="btn" href="https://ebneo.org/author-instructions/" rel="noopener">Read author instructions</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
